 I will go poke around the code some more to try to learn the proper way to handle `USE_MULTIVIEW`.","created_at":"2025-08-13T17:47:58Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T17:47:58Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109447#discussion_r2274206259","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109447","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2274206259"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109447#discussion_r2274206259"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109447"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2274206259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":103,"original_line":100,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2274024048,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":17,"position":25,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2288354022","pull_request_review_id":3136882210,"id":2288354022,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6IZYLm","diff_hunk":"@@ -102,6 +130,8 @@ void main() {\n \tvec4 color = texture(source_color, uv_interp);\n #endif\n \n+\t// SSAO might be better here, before the glow, but the colors are still SRGB.","path":"drivers/gles3/shaders/effects/post.glsl","commit_id":"317c7a4af064da07f8994c76b33c893295674914","original_commit_id":"317c7a4af064da07f8994c76b33c893295674914","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"It’s possible that Compatibility could be adjusted to perform the sRGB -> linear conversion before this line so it would be:\n\n1) sRGB -> linear\n2) SSAO\n3) Glow\n4) Tonemap\n\nThis will require more work to ensure that the glow and luminance multiplier are adapted to work correctly in linear space. Also, I’m not sure if it makes sense to apply SSAO before the luminance multiplier? (I actually don’t yet know what this luminance multiplier is, but the current approach of multiplying in sRGB space is colorimetricly incorrect.)\n\nAnyway, I think this could all be reworked in a future PR, since it will require reworking these other existing parts.","created_at":"2025-08-20T14:23:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-16T17:56:46Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109447#discussion_r2288354022","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109447","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2288354022"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109447#discussion_r2288354022"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109447"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2288354022/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":133,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":46,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2436932442","pull_request_review_id":3346240343,"id":2436932442,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6RQKNa","diff_hunk":"@@ -102,6 +130,8 @@ void main() {\n \tvec4 color = texture(source_color, uv_interp);\n #endif\n \n+\t// SSAO might be better here, before the glow, but the colors are still SRGB.","path":"drivers/gles3/shaders/effects/post.glsl","commit_id":"317c7a4af064da07f8994c76b33c893295674914","original_commit_id":"317c7a4af064da07f8994c76b33c893295674914","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In #110671 I decided to keep glow blending before the sRGB -> linear conversion. This is because the glow texture is generated based on nonlinear sRGB-encoded values, so it only makes sense to blend this glow texture with similarly nonlinear sRGB-encoded scene values.\r\n\r\nIt's unlikely that this will change, because it will be costly to be converting to linear when generating the glow texture. So this PR probably needs to be left as-is and SSAO will not behave nicely with glow because of this.","created_at":"2025-10-16T17:55:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-16T17:55:24Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109447#discussion_r2436932442","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109447","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2436932442"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109447#discussion_r2436932442"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109447"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2436932442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":133,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2288354022,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":46,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]